*.iml
.gradle
/local.properties
/.idea
.DS_Store
/build
**/build/
/captures
.externalNativeBuild
.cxx
local.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
# One deliberate exception: the debug key is committed so every build shares a signature and can be
# installed over the last one. It cannot publish anything — Play rejects debug-signed APKs — and its
# password is the universally known "android", so there is no secret in it. The rules above still
# protect every release key, and keystore.properties stays ignored. See app/build.gradle.kts.
!keystore/debug.keystore
/.kotlin

# Roborazzi writes rendered screens here. They ARE committed on purpose so the UI can be
# reviewed on GitHub without installing anything, but the diff/compare output is noise.
**/build/outputs/roborazzi/
screenshots/diff/
screenshots/compare/

# Scratch space for CI artefacts pulled down for review: logs, screenshot zips.
# Committed once by an over-broad "git add -A"; kept out from here on.
.ci/
